        </div>
        <div>
          <p>We look forward for your business.</p>
          <p>For any queries, please feel free to contact your Customer Experience Manager {{customerName}}, @
            {{customerNumber}} or write to us @ onesify@sifycorp.com</p>
        </div>
        <div class="Date-time">
          <div class="name">
            <p>Best Regards</p>
            <p>Team One Sify</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <div class="bottom-add">
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="address mb-0">
                <p class="sub-heading primary">Sify Technologies</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>Il Floor, TIDEL Park, No.4,
                  <li>Rajiv Gandhi Salai, Taramani,</li>
                  <li>Chennai - 600113</li>
